<section
  class="bg-alabaster xs:pt-16 relative z-10 px-5 pt-12 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:pt-20"
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-344">
    {
      /* The pair of columns rise together as they reach the viewport, and the
         row of figures rises after them as one piece, so its rules stay ruled
         while it moves. See `reveal.astro`. */
    }
    <div
      data-reveal-group
      class="w-full space-y-8 gap-x-14 pb-12 md:flex lg:gap-x-20"
    >
      <div data-reveal class="md:w-1/2">
        <p
          class="font-newsreader text-ink text-2xl font-extralight md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
        >
          We began in a converted garage in 2011 with one commission and a
          conviction that design and building should not be separate businesses.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal class="md:w-1/2">
        <p class="font-instrument opacity-65 xl:text-lg">
          Fifteen years later we are fourteen: architects, interior designers,
          and project managers working exclusively on one-of-a-kind homes, from
          forested mountain retreats to modern infill in the city.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p class="font-instrument opacity-65 xl:text-lg">
          We keep construction oversight in-house alongside a small group of
          vetted general contractors. It is a slower way to grow a practice and
          a faster way to build a house.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      data-reveal
      class="grid grid-cols-2 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:pb-16 xl:pb-20"
    >
      {
        [
          {
            p1: "14",
            p2: "Architects, Designers, & PMs",
          },
          {
            p1: "8-10",
            p2: "Active projects at a time",
          },
          {
            p1: "2011",
            p2: "Year founded",
          },
          {
            p1: "62",
            p2: "Homes completed",
          },
        ].map((obj, idx) => (
          <div
            class:list={[
              "border-ink/14 px-3.5 py-5 md:space-y-1 md:px-5 lg:px-3.5 xl:space-y-1.5 xl:px-5 xl:py-6",
              idx === 0 && "border-t lg:border-b",
              idx === 1 && "border-t border-l lg:border-b",
              idx === 2 && "border-y lg:border-l",
              idx === 3 && "border-y border-l",
            ]}
          >
            <p class="font-newsreader text-pine text-4xl font-light md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">
              {obj.p1}
            </p>
            <p class="font-jetbrains text-ink/65 text-2xs uppercase md:text-xs">
              {obj.p2}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
